@testray.main.component.name = "Patcher Builder"

Feature: Patcher Builder Smoke testing
	Testing the Patcher Builder smoke test.

Setup:
	* I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage

Scenario: Run test smoke test
	As a TSE, I should be able to run the test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke job

	Given I start the test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke job for the "2.x" branch with the following parameters
	| git.branch      | 2.x     |
	| github.username | liferay |
	And I wait for "5" seconds
	And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
	And I get the current build number for the short job titled "test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke(2x-test)"
	And I check the job with the name "test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke(2x-test)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" for completion
	And I go to the Patcher Builder Jenkins homepage
	Then the job with the name "test-fixpack-builder-main-smoke(2x-test)" and build number "${staticJobBuildNumber}" should have been successful